 i tre amici potrebbe rivelarsi una ghiotta occasione di riscatto oppure…."},{"language":"en-US","title":"All You Need is Crime","overview":"In the present day, three friends to make ends meet invent a \"criminal tour\" for the places which were scenes of the Banda della Magliana criminal acts, even with vintage clothes. Suddenly they are catapulted in the 1982, during the Spain World Cup, facing the real Banda della Magliana, which at that time had the control over illegal bets."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gdBbGiISgykc83IDbYqOZqov4Mn.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gdBbGiISgykc83IDbYqOZqov4Mn.png","language":"it","width":642,"height":376}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aDGL90fBZs0vNDdl0qPxmCMlkW.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aDGL90fBZs0vNDdl0qPxmCMlkW.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hLRaDo7CtihKP0oILod2cdau3MF.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hLRaDo7CtihKP0oILod2cdau3MF.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2Qs3QjTePWcGdqhpav8HBQ6faoD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2Qs3QjTePWcGdqhpav8HBQ6faoD.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tlKOGMzIaJY51NpgpqRsSd8oMNs.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tlKOGMzIaJY51NpgpqRsSd8oMNs.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o9IWP10GMSdYGPgg2M0ZyvGNrTz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o9IWP10GMSdYGPgg2M0ZyvGNrTz.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rOVzl7DcuSyDueLqF5xqdBj2GPJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rOVzl7DcuSyDueLqF5xqdBj2GPJ.jpg","language":"it","widt